WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 9=

01:52.250 --> 01:54.130
Don't just stare at me.

01:54.370 --> 01:56.220
We're on the same side here.

01:56.890 --> 01:57.460
Are we?

02:01.204 --> 02:02.626
(Fei Family Tai Chi Manual)

02:05.220 --> 02:06.020
You were bought off

02:06.020 --> 02:06.940
a long time ago.

02:07.648 --> 02:08.650
And all this stuff, too.

02:08.790 --> 02:09.520
What are they for?

02:09.920 --> 02:10.810
Trying to buy me off?

02:11.100 --> 02:12.410
Our family may not be well-off,

02:12.840 --> 02:14.340
but I'm not that shallow.

02:14.404 --> 02:15.590
I'm not selling my daughter.

02:15.590 --> 02:17.650
Mom, please don't be mad.

02:17.840 --> 02:19.410
I asked him to buy these.

02:19.410 --> 02:20.650
It's not his fault.

02:21.590 --> 02:22.060
Mrs. Fei,

02:22.400 --> 02:23.810
I've been thinking

02:24.026 --> 02:25.130
about why you won't agree

02:25.500 --> 02:26.460
to let Fei Ni marry me.

02:29.280 --> 02:30.740
I'm not as qualified as Ye Feng,

02:31.600 --> 02:33.600
but a marriage is more than

02:33.940 --> 02:35.220
just about material life.

02:36.070 --> 02:37.650
We should be spiritually in sync.

02:39.250 --> 02:40.310
And in that regard,

02:41.460 --> 02:42.570
no one can compare to me.

02:42.910 --> 02:44.370
Don't give me that flowery talk.

02:44.370 --> 02:45.340
I don't understand it.

02:45.600 --> 02:46.210
All I know is,

02:46.210 --> 02:47.060
my daughter

02:47.190 --> 02:48.690
will not trade her future

02:48.690 --> 02:50.530
for one unit.

02:51.390 --> 02:52.940
Ni, be honest with me.

02:52.970 --> 02:54.970
Are you in such a rush
to marry Fang Muyang

02:54.970 --> 02:56.650
because Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory

02:56.804 --> 02:58.410
promised to allocate him
a unit?

02:59.030 --> 03:01.540
How can you say that about Ni?

03:01.540 --> 03:02.970
She's not that kind of person.

03:02.970 --> 03:03.810
I am.

03:07.560 --> 03:10.020
I'm marrying Fang Muyang
for the unit.

03:10.410 --> 03:10.940
But...

03:10.940 --> 03:11.810
You're doing this,

03:11.970 --> 03:14.370
so your brother and Lin Mei
can get married sooner.

03:14.915 --> 03:16.640
You want to free up a place for them,

03:17.150 --> 03:17.800
don't you?

03:22.740 --> 03:23.530
No.

03:34.810 --> 03:35.740
Not entirely.

03:36.460 --> 03:37.540
If I hadn't asked Lin Mei,

03:37.540 --> 03:40.340
I wouldn't have known
you were marrying him for a unit.

03:41.710 --> 03:42.310
Ni,

03:42.840 --> 03:44.710
I know you
and your brother are close.

03:44.710 --> 03:46.650
I know you care about him.

03:48.350 --> 03:49.530
But you can't

03:49.530 --> 03:51.740
throw your whole life away for him.

03:52.480 --> 03:53.420
I won't agree to this.

03:53.420 --> 03:54.650
Not in a million years.

04:02.180 --> 04:02.780
Mom.

04:06.130 --> 04:06.880
I am not

04:07.630 --> 04:09.020
doing this just for my brother.

04:10.350 --> 04:11.970
I have my own reasons.

04:12.940 --> 04:14.340
If it were only about

04:14.340 --> 04:15.570
making room for him,

04:16.010 --> 04:17.260
I could marry Ye Feng.

04:20.404 --> 04:22.250
I just don't want to live feeling small.

04:22.250 --> 04:23.626
That's why I chose Fang Muyang.

04:24.660 --> 04:26.450
Ye Feng is a good man,

04:27.620 --> 04:30.250
but we're not suited for each other.

04:32.100 --> 04:33.250
I don't want to spend my life

04:33.950 --> 04:35.620
always feeling inferior

04:37.940 --> 04:39.060
around his family.

04:43.440 --> 04:44.370
I know about that.

04:44.660 --> 04:46.620
Ye Feng doesn't
want Ni to go to college.

04:51.620 --> 04:53.250
Fine, even if it's not Ye Feng,

04:53.250 --> 04:55.940
can't you find someone
with similar prospects?

04:56.190 --> 04:57.060
Fang Muyang is...

04:58.540 --> 04:59.710
All things aside,

04:59.940 --> 05:01.710
other than that "hero" title of his,

05:01.710 --> 05:02.810
what does he really have?

05:03.210 --> 05:05.010
No matter how rich a man is,

05:05.182 --> 05:06.270
it still belongs to them,

05:06.270 --> 05:07.330
not me.

05:07.920 --> 05:09.660
They can take it back anytime.

05:10.250 --> 05:11.500
And honestly,

05:11.580 --> 05:13.130
I think Fang Muyang is the right one.

05:14.680 --> 05:15.920
He's no worse than anyone else.

05:16.715 --> 05:18.540
When he was sent down
to the countryside,

05:18.770 --> 05:20.250
he was recommended for college.

05:20.860 --> 05:21.680
He didn't hesitate

05:21.680 --> 05:22.860
to save a life.

05:23.210 --> 05:23.760
Why shouldn't

05:23.760 --> 05:24.740
I marry a man like that?

05:37.810 --> 05:39.250
The girl

05:40.450 --> 05:41.550
makes a good point.

05:57.210 --> 05:58.550
All dressed up today?

05:58.550 --> 05:59.370
What's the occasion?

05:59.370 --> 06:00.540
We're registering our marriage.

06:00.540 --> 06:02.093
I'll bring you wedding candies later.

06:15.010 --> 06:15.860
I understand.

06:17.240 --> 06:17.810
Thank you.

06:18.804 --> 06:19.760
What did they say?

06:21.420 --> 06:22.400
The hospital said

06:22.400 --> 06:23.260
Fang Muyang

06:23.260 --> 06:25.010
left early this morning all dressed up.

06:26.270 --> 06:29.920
Did you tell him we're waiting
here to go to the subdistrict office

06:29.920 --> 06:31.560
(Modesty helps one improve)
to register?

06:31.600 --> 06:33.271
(Pride makes one fall behind)
I told him.

06:33.420 --> 06:34.110
See?

06:34.570 --> 06:36.130
We've been waiting for over an hour.

06:36.420 --> 06:38.540
I told you Fang Muyang isn't
someone you should marry.

06:38.604 --> 06:40.450
There's no telling
what's going on in his head.

06:41.070 --> 06:42.250
He seems perfectly fine,

06:42.380 --> 06:43.450
but when it really matters,

06:44.010 --> 06:45.740
who knows when he might lose it.

06:46.810 --> 06:47.520
If you ask me,

06:47.770 --> 06:49.460
maybe he had an episode
and wandered off.

06:50.030 --> 06:50.840
Let's go home.

06:51.890 --> 06:53.030
Let's wait a little longer.

06:53.420 --> 06:54.370
Wait for what?

06:54.770 --> 06:55.540
If Fang Muyang

06:55.540 --> 06:57.060
doesn't explain himself today,

06:57.093 --> 06:58.493
you are not to see him again.

07:01.620 --> 07:02.460
And you,

07:02.460 --> 07:04.280
making your mother upset in this heat.

07:08.190 --> 07:08.830
Well...

07:18.300 --> 07:20.780
Fei Ni, marriage is a serious matter.

07:21.330 --> 07:22.880
You need to think it through.

07:23.710 --> 07:24.980
If it doesn't feel right,

07:24.980 --> 07:26.180
it's not too late to stop.

07:26.800 --> 07:27.980
There's no need to rush this.

07:29.200 --> 07:31.130
Your brother wouldn't agree otherwise.

07:35.100 --> 07:36.740
Maybe we should head back first.

07:37.130 --> 07:38.810
Your parents could be upset.

07:40.120 --> 07:40.770
Lin Mei.

07:45.920 --> 07:46.920
You're hiding something.

07:47.570 --> 07:48.450
I'm not.

07:51.740 --> 07:52.860
My brother is back?

07:54.250 --> 07:55.540
I didn't know.

07:56.810 --> 07:57.380
Did you

07:57.380 --> 07:58.890
tell him that Fang Muyang and I

07:58.890 --> 07:59.740
are getting married?

07:59.940 --> 08:01.420
I didn't.

08:01.420 --> 08:02.860
Did my brother go to see him?

08:02.860 --> 08:03.620
Tell me.

08:07.190 --> 08:07.770
He said

08:08.300 --> 08:10.210
he went to talk to Fang Muyang.

08:13.893 --> 08:16.560
Heilongjiang Production
and Construction Corps, 29th Regiment,

08:16.560 --> 08:18.626
Agriculture Unit 2, Squad 3,
educated youth Fei Ting

08:18.693 --> 08:20.940
salutes Comrade Fang Muyang,
hero of lifesaving.

08:22.180 --> 08:22.830
Brother-in-law.

08:23.180 --> 08:24.740
How do I shake your hand if I'm tied up?

08:28.180 --> 08:28.980
Comrade Fang Muyang,

08:28.980 --> 08:30.950
since you're indisposed,
no need for formalities.

08:30.980 --> 08:32.140
At least untie me first.

08:32.140 --> 08:32.720
Stop.

08:33.204 --> 08:33.900
Hold your horses.

08:34.330 --> 08:35.380
Who's your brother-in-law?

08:35.850 --> 08:36.300
Fine.

08:36.826 --> 08:38.660
I'll call you what Fei Ni calls you.
Brother.

08:38.660 --> 08:39.410
Totally not!

08:42.660 --> 08:43.440
Brother.

08:44.210 --> 08:44.610
Brother!

08:45.020 --> 08:46.330
No, no. Comrade Fei Ting.

08:46.330 --> 08:47.020
Comrade Fei Ting.

08:47.020 --> 08:48.050
This is between us.

08:48.050 --> 08:48.670
This is totally

08:48.670 --> 08:49.210
unnecessary.

08:49.210 --> 08:50.120
I'm asking you now.

08:50.520 --> 08:51.360
Answer honestly.

08:51.670 --> 08:52.140
All right.

08:52.610 --> 08:54.260
Are you really stupid
or just pretending?

08:54.450 --> 08:55.180
I'm really stupid.

08:55.271 --> 08:56.730
Then you shouldn't marry my sister.

08:56.730 --> 08:58.020
She can't marry a fool.

08:58.582 --> 08:59.760
Then I'm not stupid.

08:59.782 --> 09:01.060
That's even worse.

09:01.150 --> 09:02.260
That makes you a liar.

09:02.600 --> 09:03.130
Brother.

09:04.180 --> 09:04.780
Fei Ting.

09:05.090 --> 09:06.260
What are you doing?

09:06.260 --> 09:07.730
Fei Ting, didn't you say

09:07.810 --> 09:08.970
you just wanted to talk?

09:08.970 --> 09:10.140
Why are you holding a knife?

09:10.140 --> 09:11.420
I'm just trying to scare him.

09:12.540 --> 09:13.530
Why are you all here?

09:13.560 --> 09:14.848
I told you not to say anything.

09:14.960 --> 09:15.920
This is between you two.

09:15.920 --> 09:16.850
Work it out yourselves.

09:17.120 --> 09:18.260
Either way, I'm the bad guy.

09:19.360 --> 09:21.020
Why did you tie him up?

09:21.260 --> 09:23.520
Ni, are you really
going to marry a fool?

09:23.570 --> 09:24.670
He's not a fool.

09:24.670 --> 09:25.750
He's a hero.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.520
Even if he is,
he's not marrying my sister.

09:27.660 --> 09:29.620
I know you're doing this
for Lin Mei and me.

09:29.620 --> 09:31.850
I told you, it's not because of you.

09:31.850 --> 09:33.380
Why won't you believe me?

09:49.350 --> 09:49.870
Brother.

09:50.850 --> 09:52.880
I know you're worried about me.

09:53.110 --> 09:54.260
But you know me.

09:54.660 --> 09:56.210
I'm very practical.

09:56.448 --> 09:58.260
If this were about
freeing up a room for you,

09:58.420 --> 09:59.850
why would I marry him?

09:59.850 --> 10:01.570
I could find someone
with better prospects.

10:03.020 --> 10:04.730
That's what I told him too.

10:04.730 --> 10:05.850
But he wouldn't believe me.

10:05.960 --> 10:07.140
He insisted on coming back.

10:09.293 --> 10:10.730
But he's not right in the head.

10:10.850 --> 10:12.060
His heart is pure.

10:12.730 --> 10:14.260
That makes him better than many men.

10:16.260 --> 10:17.060
Brother,

10:18.060 --> 10:19.570
ask Lin Mei.

10:20.380 --> 10:21.420
Does she like you

10:23.330 --> 10:24.570
because of your prospects?

10:48.020 --> 10:49.660
If you ever treat Ni badly,

10:50.648 --> 10:52.380
I'll tie you up
and throw you in the river.

10:54.060 --> 10:54.850
Don't worry.

10:56.380 --> 10:57.610
I never would.

11:05.570 --> 11:06.540
Lin Mei...

11:09.210 --> 11:10.660
Let's go register the marriage.

11:12.730 --> 11:13.660
Wait at home for us.

11:13.970 --> 11:15.020
Come on, let's go.

11:21.420 --> 11:26.300
(People's Photo Studio)

11:28.420 --> 11:29.210
All right, you two.

11:29.500 --> 11:30.720
Stand a little closer.

11:32.020 --> 11:33.450
Miss, move toward the center.

11:33.900 --> 11:34.770
That's it.

11:35.470 --> 11:36.850
A bit closer to your husband.

11:38.750 --> 11:40.170
Good. Relax.

11:40.680 --> 11:42.150
Sir, loosen up a little.

11:42.720 --> 11:43.540
That's right.

11:43.680 --> 11:45.390
You're newlyweds. Look happy.

11:46.010 --> 11:46.950
Miss, smile.

11:47.850 --> 11:48.620
Smile.

11:49.020 --> 11:49.810
Good, good.

11:50.950 --> 11:51.970
Sir, give me a smile too.

11:52.250 --> 11:54.210
Three, two, one.

11:54.420 --> 11:58.260
(Wedding Commemoration 1975)

11:58.780 --> 12:01.260
Today is a joyous day.

12:02.250 --> 12:04.660
From now on, we're one family.

12:05.610 --> 12:06.780
I only have one request.

12:07.380 --> 12:09.850
Treat Ni well for the rest of your life.

12:10.610 --> 12:11.330
Yes, yes.

12:12.090 --> 12:14.980
I wish you both
a prosperous life together

12:15.060 --> 12:16.190
and lasting happiness.

12:16.260 --> 12:17.880
Thank you, Dad.
Thank you, Mom.

12:18.850 --> 12:19.780
Don't worry.

12:19.915 --> 12:21.420
From now on,
I only listen to Fei Ni.

12:26.810 --> 12:27.420
Fei Ni.

12:28.540 --> 12:29.060
I...

12:33.090 --> 12:34.570
I don't even know what to say.

12:35.420 --> 12:36.940
We don't need to say anything.

12:40.140 --> 12:41.060
I wish you happiness.

12:42.940 --> 12:43.940
I wish us happiness.

12:44.020 --> 12:45.850
Yes, yes.
Wishing you both happiness.

12:45.850 --> 12:46.540
All right.

12:48.140 --> 12:49.490
Come on, let's eat.

12:50.810 --> 12:51.330
Brother.

12:51.730 --> 12:54.060
Fang Muyang and I
have talked it over.

12:54.210 --> 12:56.060
Once the unit is assigned,
we'll move out.

12:56.210 --> 12:58.020
You and Lin Mei should hurry, too.

12:58.260 --> 12:59.850
We're not in a rush.

13:01.140 --> 13:02.380
You're not, but I am.

13:02.940 --> 13:05.660
No, I am. I'm in a rush.

13:05.660 --> 13:06.420
How could I not be?

13:06.420 --> 13:07.690
- Good. You should be.
- I am.

13:07.690 --> 13:10.060
Let's make it happen fast.

13:14.260 --> 13:14.780
Cheers!

13:15.520 --> 13:16.160
Cheers!

13:20.970 --> 13:21.660
Dig in.

13:21.660 --> 13:23.420
Come on, dig in. Eat.

13:23.660 --> 13:24.660
It's a wonderful day.

13:24.660 --> 13:26.090
Let me perform something.

13:26.780 --> 13:27.570
All right.

13:27.920 --> 13:30.090
The moment I see the princess
steal the command arrow,

13:30.090 --> 13:31.940
my heart fills with joy.

13:31.940 --> 13:37.810
I stand at the palace gates
and call for the guards.

13:42.900 --> 13:43.660
Fang,

13:43.970 --> 13:45.610
you can even fix electronics?

13:45.850 --> 13:47.810
Mom, I learned a bit before.

13:49.060 --> 13:50.060
Impressive.

13:50.060 --> 13:51.020
Have some water.

13:53.210 --> 13:54.180
It's getting late.

13:54.540 --> 13:55.260
Fei Ting,

13:55.590 --> 13:56.500
stop busying yourself.

13:56.500 --> 13:57.460
Take Lin Mei home.

13:57.460 --> 13:58.180
It's late.

13:58.180 --> 13:58.970
Okay, Mom.

13:59.180 --> 14:00.760
Lin Mei, stop working.

14:00.760 --> 14:01.570
I've got it.

14:01.660 --> 14:02.960
Head back. It's too late.

14:02.960 --> 14:04.440
Don't make your parents worry.

14:04.540 --> 14:05.130
Come here.

14:05.180 --> 14:05.940
Here, here.

14:08.530 --> 14:10.720
Brother, don't just leave her
at the building entrance.

14:10.720 --> 14:12.380
Say hello to her parents.

14:12.380 --> 14:13.210
I know.

14:14.271 --> 14:15.360
Take it slow on the way.

14:15.360 --> 14:16.382
It's dark. Ride carefully.

14:16.382 --> 14:17.020
We're heading out.

14:17.020 --> 14:17.380
All right.

14:17.380 --> 14:18.060
Don't worry, Mom.

14:18.210 --> 14:19.140
We've got everything.

14:19.140 --> 14:19.970
Stay safe.

14:20.570 --> 14:21.210
Here, Ni.

14:22.850 --> 14:24.060
Tonight,

14:24.060 --> 14:26.660
you and Fang Muyang can
sleep in our bed.

14:27.020 --> 14:28.420
What about you two?

14:28.982 --> 14:29.937
We'll be fine.

14:29.937 --> 14:31.970
Your mom and I will stay
at your second aunt's place.

14:31.970 --> 14:33.020
No need, Mom, Dad.

14:33.071 --> 14:34.420
I got the letter of introduction.

14:34.648 --> 14:36.610
Fei Ni and I will stay
at the guesthouse tonight.

14:37.537 --> 14:38.430
Is that all right?

14:38.610 --> 14:40.210
Fang really thought this through.

14:44.060 --> 14:44.850
Ni,

14:45.210 --> 14:46.180
come inside with Mom.

14:46.180 --> 14:47.350
I need to tell you something.

14:47.490 --> 14:48.280
Go have some water.

14:48.280 --> 14:49.060
Sit a bit longer.

14:51.540 --> 14:52.030
Listen.

14:52.420 --> 14:54.610
Why does it sound a bit fuzzy?

14:54.610 --> 14:55.420
Let me hear.

14:55.420 --> 14:56.700
Here, listen.

14:58.020 --> 14:58.810
Ni,

15:00.850 --> 15:01.660
well,

15:02.420 --> 15:05.570
today is your big day with Fang.

15:07.210 --> 15:10.020
Do you understand the procedures?

15:11.850 --> 15:13.140
What procedures?

15:13.730 --> 15:16.380
We already got
our marriage certificate.

15:17.140 --> 15:19.180
That's the state's procedure.

15:19.660 --> 15:22.260
I mean the procedure
between you two.

15:28.450 --> 15:29.380
Well,

15:31.580 --> 15:32.610
as a newlywed couple,

15:33.240 --> 15:34.450
on your wedding night,

15:35.090 --> 15:36.540
first comes unity,

15:36.940 --> 15:37.850
then comes tension.

15:38.448 --> 15:39.310
You should follow

15:39.730 --> 15:40.970
a gradual approach,

15:42.660 --> 15:43.810
stay modest and cautious,

15:44.610 --> 15:46.530
and avoid arrogance or impatience.

15:49.060 --> 15:49.850
Mom,

15:50.950 --> 15:52.060
what are you talking about?

15:53.660 --> 15:55.600
I'm sharing my experience with you.

15:57.380 --> 15:59.180
Fang isn't very worldly.

15:59.540 --> 16:01.850
There are some things
you'll have to guide him through.

16:02.180 --> 16:02.850
Ni,

16:02.850 --> 16:03.490
don't be shy.

16:03.490 --> 16:05.260
- Mom!
- You're husband and wife now.

16:05.260 --> 16:06.580
Please stop.

16:08.370 --> 16:09.730
This is embarrassing for me too.

16:10.380 --> 16:11.810
If I don't tell you now,

16:11.810 --> 16:14.048
who are you going to ask
once you get to the guesthouse?

16:14.190 --> 16:14.620
Listen.

16:14.620 --> 16:16.420
You need to be mindful of Fang's health.

16:16.660 --> 16:17.920
I've heard that

16:18.115 --> 16:19.893
if someone has issues with their mind,

16:20.020 --> 16:22.060
it might affect other areas too.

16:22.570 --> 16:24.660
Mom, I'm leaving.

16:26.970 --> 16:28.090
I made myself clear, right?

16:28.700 --> 16:32.900
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Guesthouse)

16:37.740 --> 16:38.320
So?

16:38.940 --> 16:40.330
I prepared all this in advance.

16:48.540 --> 16:49.380
Why is there

16:50.300 --> 16:51.380
only one bed?

17:45.450 --> 17:46.230
Fang Muyang.

17:53.820 --> 17:54.620
What?

17:55.604 --> 17:56.804
I'm going to wash up.

17:57.340 --> 17:57.940
Together?

18:02.860 --> 18:04.140
I already washed at home.

18:10.730 --> 18:11.530
Wait for me.

18:34.490 --> 18:35.620
Comrade Fang Muyang.

18:37.982 --> 18:38.960
Please, have a seat.

18:53.730 --> 18:56.100
Given our rather special relationship,

18:56.620 --> 18:58.490
I've drafted a written agreement.

18:58.800 --> 18:59.630
Take a look.

19:00.150 --> 19:01.040
If you agree,

19:01.040 --> 19:02.010
just sign your name.

19:05.130 --> 19:06.420
Marriage Agreement.

19:07.050 --> 19:08.970
(Marriage Agreement)
Comrade Fei Ni and Comrade Fang Muyang

19:08.970 --> 19:10.340
have reached an agreement

19:10.340 --> 19:12.180
on their post-marital life,

19:12.530 --> 19:13.690
based on equality and consent,

19:14.420 --> 19:15.730
after friendly consultation,

19:16.180 --> 19:17.620
and both parties shall abide by it.

19:32.380 --> 19:35.340
The two parties shall be
husband and wife in name only.

19:36.010 --> 19:37.100
They shall neither enjoy

19:37.100 --> 19:40.490
nor fulfill any obligations
of a real marital relationship.

19:53.300 --> 19:56.580
(Fang Muyang)

20:12.180 --> 20:13.420
You'd better keep that safe.

20:14.900 --> 20:15.420
Of course.

20:16.140 --> 20:17.250
I'll guard this carefully.

20:22.940 --> 20:23.690
Fei Ni,

20:25.715 --> 20:27.404
there's something I want to tell you.

20:29.420 --> 20:30.420
My memory has come back.

20:32.180 --> 20:33.620
Your memory is back?

20:35.180 --> 20:36.190
When did that happen?

20:36.190 --> 20:37.671
Why are you only telling me now?

20:38.100 --> 20:39.210
I didn't tell you because

20:39.210 --> 20:40.770
you once said
that once I got better,

20:41.770 --> 20:43.420
you wouldn't look after me anymore.

20:46.730 --> 20:48.140
But now we're married.

20:49.010 --> 20:50.580
So I'm not afraid anymore.

20:55.530 --> 20:56.160
Fei Ni,

20:59.210 --> 21:00.010
thank you.

21:03.315 --> 21:05.100
Thank you for letting me
into your family.

21:24.530 --> 21:25.620
This is for self-defense.

21:26.471 --> 21:27.770
I know you don't trust me yet.

21:36.004 --> 21:37.690
You take the bed.
I'll sleep on the floor.

21:37.690 --> 21:39.420
The floor's too hard.

21:41.180 --> 21:42.100
Feeling sorry for me?

21:43.310 --> 21:44.660
Or we could squeeze in together.

21:44.730 --> 21:45.290
No.

21:45.860 --> 21:47.960
Comrade Fang Muyang,
you'll just have to make do.

21:49.990 --> 21:50.550
All right.

22:07.300 --> 22:09.380
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Guesthouse)

22:09.380 --> 22:10.830
Are you asleep, Fang Muyang?

22:11.490 --> 22:12.070
No.

22:22.690 --> 22:24.770
It feels like I'm dreaming.

22:28.620 --> 22:31.050
When we were kids,
I had bad luck whenever I ran into you.

22:32.180 --> 22:34.690
But now it's you

22:36.150 --> 22:37.870
who's brought me this good fortune.

22:40.170 --> 22:41.080
I hope that

22:42.440 --> 22:43.560
only good fortune

22:44.800 --> 22:45.940
awaits us from now on.

22:51.040 --> 22:51.770
Fang Muyang,

22:53.580 --> 22:55.620
have you ever thought about

22:56.660 --> 22:58.690
how we'd set up our home?

22:59.970 --> 23:00.660
No.

23:02.820 --> 23:05.210
I've imagined it so many times.

23:05.820 --> 23:09.140
If this room were our home,

23:09.580 --> 23:10.660
I'd put

23:11.210 --> 23:12.820
a small desk

23:13.010 --> 23:14.100
right over here,

23:14.620 --> 23:16.900
and a big bookshelf beside it.

23:18.100 --> 23:18.900
What about you?

23:20.100 --> 23:22.010
Then I'd put

23:22.420 --> 23:26.290
a square dining table over here,

23:27.010 --> 23:28.770
and then

23:29.400 --> 23:30.140
a sofa here.

23:30.620 --> 23:33.160
A sofa here?

23:33.690 --> 23:35.760
Wouldn't that take up too much space?

23:36.420 --> 23:38.290
But I like the table.

23:38.290 --> 23:39.010
I really do.

23:41.530 --> 23:43.140
Then, I'd put

23:43.720 --> 23:45.100
a sewing machine

23:46.310 --> 23:47.100
right here.

23:47.690 --> 23:49.420
I'd add

23:49.610 --> 23:51.210
a chest of drawers,

23:51.820 --> 23:54.380
and two long benches.

23:54.730 --> 23:55.940
Wait, wait.

23:57.690 --> 24:00.770
At this rate,
the room's going to be packed.

24:04.940 --> 24:07.340
We haven't even placed the bed yet.

24:07.490 --> 24:08.210
That's right.

24:08.950 --> 24:10.420
We didn't plan for the bed.

24:10.420 --> 24:11.940
So where are we sleeping?

24:12.010 --> 24:13.380
We can't hang from the wall.

24:13.380 --> 24:14.900
Then, let's start over.

24:19.210 --> 24:22.290
All right,
we'll begin with two single beds.

24:23.900 --> 24:26.580
If we buy two single beds
right after getting married,

24:27.180 --> 24:28.690
won't people get suspicious?

24:29.180 --> 24:30.140
Then what should we do?

24:35.340 --> 24:38.010
We should get

24:38.010 --> 24:42.180
a double bed that can be taken apart.

24:43.010 --> 24:46.290
During the day,
we put it together as one big bed.

24:46.290 --> 24:48.770
At night,
we split it into two small ones.

24:50.690 --> 24:52.010
That's actually a great idea.

24:53.340 --> 24:57.420
I'll still put
a sewing machine over here,

24:57.690 --> 25:00.380
and this will still be my little desk.

25:00.960 --> 25:03.180
I'll give up the bookshelf.

25:04.260 --> 25:06.420
I want to put an easel here.

25:06.620 --> 25:07.140
An easel?

25:07.140 --> 25:08.580
Yes, for painting.

25:10.490 --> 25:13.690
When did you get up here?

25:15.380 --> 25:16.180
Just now.

25:18.530 --> 25:19.340
Get down.

25:22.100 --> 25:23.010
Get down.

25:24.290 --> 25:26.620
Hurry up and get down.

25:28.140 --> 25:29.560
All right, it's settled then.

25:30.140 --> 25:31.050
(Jiangcheng)

25:31.050 --> 25:31.940
Please don't push.

25:31.940 --> 25:33.115
Board in an orderly manner.

25:33.137 --> 25:33.760
Watch your step.

25:33.760 --> 25:35.026
Submit the return-to-city report

25:35.026 --> 25:35.990
as soon as you get there.

25:35.990 --> 25:36.770
Got it?

25:36.770 --> 25:37.730
Got it.

25:38.010 --> 25:39.140
You've repeated that a lot.

25:39.420 --> 25:40.820
Now you're getting impatient?

25:40.830 --> 25:42.400
Everyone, stay safe.

25:42.620 --> 25:43.620
I'm telling you,

25:44.420 --> 25:45.820
if you delay it again,

25:47.580 --> 25:48.820
I won't wait for you.

25:48.970 --> 25:50.580
Everyone, hold your children's hands.

25:50.730 --> 25:51.220
Lin Mei.

25:52.180 --> 25:53.900
I was wrong before.

25:54.380 --> 25:56.380
I shouldn't have
said those things to you.

25:56.970 --> 25:59.100
I was just afraid of holding you back.

26:02.770 --> 26:04.450
Weren't you afraid I'd get upset

26:04.450 --> 26:05.620
and leave with someone else?

26:05.690 --> 26:06.380
Of course I was.

26:06.380 --> 26:08.490
I kept dreaming
you married someone else.

26:08.490 --> 26:09.010
I even...

26:09.010 --> 26:09.940
You even what?

26:10.010 --> 26:12.140
I...

26:13.290 --> 26:15.250
I was so upset
that I plowed a few extra acres.

26:22.420 --> 26:23.010
I knew it.

26:23.010 --> 26:24.915
Nothing good
ever comes out of your mouth.

26:25.580 --> 26:26.650
How did I

26:26.930 --> 26:28.290
ever fall for you?

26:29.140 --> 26:30.730
Guess I'm just lucky.

26:31.380 --> 26:32.210
But don't worry.

26:32.293 --> 26:34.180
I'll do everything I can
to come back early.

26:34.340 --> 26:36.140
As soon as I'm back, I'll propose.

26:36.580 --> 26:37.420
It's a promise.

26:38.050 --> 26:38.730
Yes.

26:43.690 --> 26:44.490
I'm heading off.

26:45.340 --> 26:46.530
Here, take this.

26:53.420 --> 26:53.820
Go on.

26:54.182 --> 26:55.115
You should head back.

26:55.620 --> 26:56.660
Take care of yourself.

26:56.970 --> 26:57.620
Wait for me.

26:58.970 --> 26:59.380
Go on.

27:00.210 --> 27:01.340
Eat well and get some rest.

27:01.530 --> 27:02.050
Yes.

27:02.820 --> 27:03.580
Stay safe!

27:11.860 --> 27:14.820
(Jiangcheng)

27:15.100 --> 27:21.660
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

27:21.660 --> 27:23.182
(Marriage Certificate)
All right.

27:23.420 --> 27:24.490
Wonderful!

27:24.737 --> 27:27.250
On behalf of Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory, congratulations!

27:27.620 --> 27:30.180
May you learn from each other

27:30.180 --> 27:31.420
and make progress together.

27:31.420 --> 27:33.380
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

27:33.420 --> 27:34.180
You're welcome.

27:34.582 --> 27:36.290
If there's nothing else, you may go.

27:47.180 --> 27:47.970
Ms. Xu,

27:48.620 --> 27:51.730
you didn't assign me housing before

27:51.900 --> 27:52.970
because I was single

27:53.290 --> 27:54.940
and married employees had priority.

27:55.180 --> 27:55.970
But as you can see,

27:57.180 --> 27:58.490
I'm married now.

27:58.970 --> 28:00.420
Fei Ni is also a factory employee.

28:00.582 --> 28:02.493
We qualify for housing now, don't we?

28:04.820 --> 28:06.210
I did say that.

28:06.900 --> 28:08.180
As a cadre,

28:08.380 --> 28:10.210
I stand by my word.

28:10.970 --> 28:12.420
But in this round of allocations,

28:12.620 --> 28:14.420
there aren't many new dorm units.

28:15.380 --> 28:17.380
Most are vacant older ones

28:17.426 --> 28:18.420
with average conditions.

28:18.620 --> 28:20.900
When the next batch
of new units is completed,

28:21.940 --> 28:23.770
I'll assign you a new place.

28:23.970 --> 28:24.770
No need, Ms. Xu.

28:25.490 --> 28:26.290
We're not picky.

28:26.620 --> 28:28.260
You told me to show some consideration.

28:28.440 --> 28:29.250
We can give up

28:29.250 --> 28:30.940
the next batch to others.

28:31.420 --> 28:32.530
We'll take an older unit.

28:32.760 --> 28:33.390
That's right.

28:33.390 --> 28:34.690
Comrade Fang Muyang.

28:35.620 --> 28:37.770
- Please understand our difficulties.
- Ms. Xu,

28:38.530 --> 28:40.090
we've already been very understanding.

28:40.730 --> 28:41.600
Fei Ni and I even

28:42.380 --> 28:44.480
had to spend
our wedding night in a guesthouse.

28:47.226 --> 28:47.900
How about this?

28:49.380 --> 28:50.620
We'll live in the guesthouse.

28:51.271 --> 28:52.770
Will the factory reimburse the cost?

28:53.250 --> 28:54.820
Are you joking?

28:55.100 --> 28:56.040
On what grounds

28:56.420 --> 28:58.010
should the factory cover that expense?

28:59.620 --> 29:00.580
Ms. Xu,

29:01.340 --> 29:02.530
I heard that

29:02.530 --> 29:04.290
on this round of housing allocations,

29:05.004 --> 29:06.100
Feng Lin is on the list.

29:09.770 --> 29:11.180
The housing list was decided

29:11.180 --> 29:14.010
collectively by the leadership.

29:15.100 --> 29:15.940
Any objections?

29:16.970 --> 29:18.770
If I remember correctly,

29:19.140 --> 29:21.340
you said housing should prioritize

29:21.340 --> 29:22.620
employees with families.

29:23.010 --> 29:24.380
But Feng Lin is single.

29:24.820 --> 29:26.770
Why does she qualify
for a unit?

29:26.970 --> 29:28.580
Feng Lin is a university graduate.

29:28.730 --> 29:30.070
She's a key talent

29:30.340 --> 29:32.180
that we are cultivating.

29:32.620 --> 29:33.820
Of course, she qualifies.

29:33.820 --> 29:35.182
I wanted to go to college, too.

29:35.226 --> 29:36.410
You refused to recommend me.

29:37.340 --> 29:38.180
Fei Ni,

29:38.604 --> 29:40.400
marrying a hero doesn't
give you the right

29:40.400 --> 29:41.730
to speak to me like this.

29:41.900 --> 29:43.680
But I'm stating facts.

29:43.680 --> 29:44.770
The fact is,

29:45.180 --> 29:46.560
no matter who you are

29:46.690 --> 29:48.210
or what contributions you've made,

29:48.210 --> 29:50.140
you cannot cause trouble
for the organization!

29:50.290 --> 29:51.490
Fang Muyang is a hero.

29:51.490 --> 29:52.940
- And we're married now.
- Fei Ni.

29:54.290 --> 29:54.730
Enough.

30:01.770 --> 30:03.790
Ms. Xu, sorry to trouble you.

30:05.420 --> 30:05.970
Let's go.

30:17.010 --> 30:19.100
You shouldn't have stopped me just now.

30:19.271 --> 30:20.960
You saw the way Xu Hongqi was acting.

30:21.140 --> 30:22.820
Arguing with her was pointless.

30:24.010 --> 30:25.710
But we can't just let it go.

30:25.940 --> 30:27.470
We're already married.

30:27.470 --> 30:29.190
Why can't we be assigned a place?

30:31.560 --> 30:32.420
Where are you going?

30:32.820 --> 30:33.970
To see the Party secretary.

30:34.010 --> 30:35.580
There must be a way to argue our case.

30:35.730 --> 30:37.380
Xu Hongqi is the director.

30:38.180 --> 30:39.250
A complaint against her

30:39.420 --> 30:40.620
won't end well for you.

30:41.180 --> 30:42.640
What if you lose your job?

30:54.530 --> 30:55.080
Fei Ni.

31:18.970 --> 31:20.010
Fang Muyang.

31:21.290 --> 31:22.300
I feel like

31:24.380 --> 31:25.900
no matter how hard I try,

31:26.210 --> 31:28.620
I can't live the life I want.

31:38.420 --> 31:40.180
Whether it's going to college

31:41.180 --> 31:42.490
or getting assigned housing,

31:43.100 --> 31:45.580
maybe I shouldn't
even hope for those things.

32:06.730 --> 32:07.770
Don't rush.

32:09.290 --> 32:10.340
I'll find a way

32:11.770 --> 32:12.970
to get your unit back.

32:15.690 --> 32:16.680
What way?

32:17.420 --> 32:18.180
Trust me.

32:21.420 --> 32:22.140
But right now,

32:23.210 --> 32:24.490
there's a more pressing matter.

32:26.337 --> 32:27.100
Come with me.

32:30.180 --> 32:33.640
Coming.

32:33.660 --> 32:34.770
Coming.

32:35.340 --> 32:36.420
What a feast today.

32:36.420 --> 32:37.420
Of course.

32:38.100 --> 32:41.180
Today marks
the 30th wedding anniversary

32:41.180 --> 32:43.620
of Comrade Wu Baoying
and Comrade Fei Mingde.

32:43.620 --> 32:45.770
We had to make it special.

32:47.690 --> 32:48.380
Honey...

32:51.770 --> 32:54.900
Thank you for taking care
of me for all these 30 years.

32:55.382 --> 32:57.115
From the bottom of my heart, thank you

32:57.160 --> 33:00.340
for giving me such wonderful children
over these past years.

33:01.248 --> 33:02.380
You've worked so hard.

33:03.420 --> 33:04.690
You too.

33:07.420 --> 33:10.010
Mom, Dad, we're back.

33:16.620 --> 33:17.448
Have some.

33:18.690 --> 33:21.580
You can stay here as long as you like.

33:22.010 --> 33:23.730
Why did you go and buy new shoes?

33:24.620 --> 33:25.290
Mom,

33:25.620 --> 33:27.140
it's a small gesture
from Fang Muyang.

33:29.340 --> 33:31.790
Exactly.
It's from the young man's heart.

33:32.140 --> 33:33.100
Come on, eat.

33:34.050 --> 33:34.660
Mom,

33:35.150 --> 33:37.100
as long as the factory
hasn't finalized the list,

33:37.360 --> 33:38.340
we still have hope.

33:39.620 --> 33:40.880
This is your home.

33:40.880 --> 33:41.940
What are you saying?

33:41.940 --> 33:42.940
You can move back in,

33:42.940 --> 33:44.848
so your dad and I won't miss you
so badly.

33:45.100 --> 33:45.690
Exactly.

33:49.100 --> 33:51.050
What about Lin Mei and my brother?

33:51.050 --> 33:52.730
Don't worry about your brother.

33:52.970 --> 33:54.420
You've done all you can.

33:54.730 --> 33:56.450
He's a grown man.

33:56.450 --> 33:57.970
If he can't find a wife,

33:57.970 --> 33:59.210
that's on him.

34:02.420 --> 34:03.770
This is all Xu Hongqi's fault.

34:04.290 --> 34:06.420
How can she go back on her word?

34:09.380 --> 34:11.170
Don't make it worse.

34:11.570 --> 34:12.260
Ni,

34:12.360 --> 34:14.010
you and Fang shouldn't
get too worked up.

34:14.170 --> 34:15.780
Xu Hongqi is still a leader,

34:15.780 --> 34:16.340
after all.

34:17.170 --> 34:18.160
If anything comes up,

34:18.740 --> 34:20.040
don't confront her head-on.

34:20.900 --> 34:22.220
Let's take it one step at a time.

34:22.700 --> 34:24.530
Tonight, you two just get some rest.

34:26.090 --> 34:27.450
You're newlyweds.

34:27.450 --> 34:28.330
Stay happy.

34:31.010 --> 34:31.900
Your mom's right.

34:33.370 --> 34:34.400
Don't worry.

34:35.610 --> 34:36.610
They may have cannons,

34:36.700 --> 34:38.530
but we've got millet and rifles.

34:38.530 --> 34:40.650
We'll fight with guerrilla tactics
and street battles.

34:40.650 --> 34:42.380
Victory shall be ours eventually.

34:43.050 --> 34:43.780
Right?

34:45.740 --> 34:46.530
Trust me.

34:49.970 --> 34:51.130
Wrap up what's left.

34:53.340 --> 34:54.530
We can't waste food.

34:54.530 --> 34:56.780
Let's carry on our fine traditions.

34:56.780 --> 34:58.170
Finish it all properly.

35:01.700 --> 35:02.440
Feel this.

35:03.020 --> 35:04.610
It's all freshly stuffed cotton.

35:06.570 --> 35:08.420
Look at
the double-happiness character.

35:08.970 --> 35:11.740
I searched for a long time
for this fabric.

35:13.450 --> 35:14.420
Do you like it?

35:14.900 --> 35:15.700
I do.

35:16.970 --> 35:18.610
Settle in and stay here.

35:18.737 --> 35:20.715
Stop worrying
about your brother and Lin Mei.

35:24.220 --> 35:24.820
Get some rest.

35:25.300 --> 35:26.300
Come on, Fang.

35:26.340 --> 35:27.293
- Get in here.
- Mom.

35:27.337 --> 35:28.226
Don't just stand there.

35:28.380 --> 35:29.700
The bed's a bit small,

35:29.700 --> 35:30.610
but you two can rest.

35:30.610 --> 35:32.300
I'll go help your dad clean up.

35:34.010 --> 35:35.220
Mom's right.

35:35.220 --> 35:36.300
The bed is a bit small.

35:36.940 --> 35:37.970
Why don't we squeeze in?

35:38.130 --> 35:38.900
In your dreams.

35:38.900 --> 35:40.160
You're sleeping on the floor.

35:41.900 --> 35:42.820
Then I'll

35:42.820 --> 35:43.970
lie down for a bit first.

36:08.420 --> 36:09.220
Honey,

36:09.820 --> 36:12.610
I wanted to have a proper
celebration with you,

36:12.780 --> 36:13.780
but it didn't work out.

36:13.780 --> 36:15.090
I'll make it up to you next year.

36:16.450 --> 36:17.700
Who says it didn't work out?

36:18.170 --> 36:19.970
The day's not over yet.

36:22.700 --> 36:23.260
Here.

36:26.050 --> 36:26.740
Come on.

36:27.170 --> 36:28.610
Then let me wish you

36:30.420 --> 36:31.700
a long life.

36:32.970 --> 36:34.740
Then, you have to live long, too.

36:34.940 --> 36:35.820
- Come on.
- Cheers.

36:40.804 --> 36:42.160
Give it to me. I'll drink with you.

36:44.420 --> 36:45.620
Another sip, one more.

36:48.170 --> 36:48.880
Slow down.

36:49.670 --> 36:50.410
It's gone again.

36:50.410 --> 36:51.420
I'll top it up for you.

37:06.610 --> 37:08.080
Still worried about the unit?

37:17.010 --> 37:18.130
It's just that

37:18.740 --> 37:20.450
I already told Lin Mei.

37:21.780 --> 37:23.220
She's bound to be disappointed.

37:24.650 --> 37:25.650
And my parents.

37:26.420 --> 37:28.010
They don't say it,

37:28.780 --> 37:30.380
but they must be anxious.

37:32.130 --> 37:32.940
And

37:35.450 --> 37:37.170
I feel like I've let you down.

37:37.740 --> 37:39.420
I suggested we get married.

37:39.940 --> 37:41.260
Now the unit's gone.

37:41.820 --> 37:42.670
In the future,

37:43.582 --> 37:45.337
you'll even be considered twice married.

37:48.650 --> 37:49.610
I don't regret it.

37:57.260 --> 37:58.740
You said earlier today

37:59.050 --> 38:00.860
that you had a way
to get the unit back.

38:01.450 --> 38:02.380
What way?

38:05.093 --> 38:06.300
Are you afraid of losing face?

38:07.650 --> 38:08.570
Of course I am.

38:09.450 --> 38:10.740
What if losing face

38:11.130 --> 38:12.450
means getting the unit back?

38:13.650 --> 38:14.820
Then, I'll have no fear.

38:23.010 --> 38:24.780
Let's go get the unit back now.

38:26.260 --> 38:27.340
Right now?

38:27.740 --> 38:28.420
How?

38:30.700 --> 38:31.530
Guerrilla tactics.

38:55.340 --> 39:00.420
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

39:57.700 --> 39:58.900
Should we think this through?

39:58.900 --> 40:01.090
This is Ms. Xu's office.

40:01.490 --> 40:03.340
Do you still want the unit?

40:06.340 --> 40:07.130
Give me a hand.

40:28.820 --> 40:30.960
What am I even doing?

40:31.050 --> 40:35.450
I'm lying in an office with a man.

40:37.090 --> 40:38.820
You said you weren't
afraid of losing face.

40:42.900 --> 40:43.820
Are you sure

40:44.250 --> 40:45.760
this will get your unit back?

40:48.530 --> 40:49.520
It's our unit.

40:52.090 --> 40:53.530
If the factory won't give it to us,

40:54.115 --> 40:55.310
I'll sleep here until they do.

40:56.700 --> 40:57.490
That's right.

40:57.970 --> 40:59.271
I'll stay and sleep with you.

41:03.450 --> 41:04.490
I mean,

41:04.650 --> 41:05.900
I'll stay here with you.

41:07.860 --> 41:08.780
I mean,

41:08.780 --> 41:10.582
you sleep here,
and I'll sleep here, too.

41:20.540 --> 41:22.450
If Ms. Xu scolds you
tomorrow morning,

41:23.340 --> 41:24.810
just put all the blame on me.

41:25.650 --> 41:27.010
She already thinks I'm a patient,

41:27.530 --> 41:28.720
that my mind works on and off.

41:29.804 --> 41:31.337
Say you were worried about me,

41:31.900 --> 41:33.300
that you had to stick by me.

41:34.340 --> 41:35.260
Whatever I do,

41:35.315 --> 41:36.260
you just follow along.

41:37.900 --> 41:38.520
Got it?

41:47.530 --> 41:48.170
What?

41:49.400 --> 41:50.810
Turn around.

41:51.650 --> 41:52.900
Turn around.

41:57.380 --> 41:58.420
Hey!

41:58.420 --> 41:59.820
Don't grab the blanket.

42:10.182 --> 42:11.040
What are you doing?

42:11.420 --> 42:12.240
Why are you moving?

42:12.693 --> 42:13.900
Taking my clothes off.

42:14.570 --> 42:15.050
You...

42:15.420 --> 42:16.610
Why?

42:16.737 --> 42:18.040
We can't do things halfway.

42:18.382 --> 42:19.737
I've got an undershirt on.

42:20.804 --> 42:21.915
I'll take mine off, too.

42:22.340 --> 42:22.970
No.

42:24.740 --> 42:25.915
I've got an undershirt on.

42:26.490 --> 42:27.140
Still no.

42:27.650 --> 42:29.050
No one takes advantage of my wife.

42:29.110 --> 42:30.720
I'm not your wife.

42:31.340 --> 42:32.260
Still no.

42:43.090 --> 42:43.930
Morning, Ms. Xu.

42:43.930 --> 42:45.000
- Morning.
- Morning, Ms. Xu.

42:45.004 --> 42:45.604
Morning.

42:47.900 --> 42:48.700
Morning, Ms. Xu.

42:48.700 --> 42:49.300
Morning.

42:57.090 --> 42:57.570
You...

42:58.530 --> 42:59.180
You two...

43:00.010 --> 43:01.260
What are you doing?

43:06.530 --> 43:07.220
Morning.

43:07.860 --> 43:08.940
Ms. Xu.

43:10.900 --> 43:11.740
Fei Ni!

43:12.490 --> 43:12.970
You...

43:12.970 --> 43:14.740
This is utterly outrageous!

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
